      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i’m already gone. i look at my dad and then i look at my own hands and i don’t even recognize myself anymore. everything is just... grey. i’m so tired of waiting for the end of this, but i’m also so tired of living through it. like i'm just a ghost in this house.",
