      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way when everything seems so bleak and unchanging. When life feels terminal, the idea of \"fixing\" anything can seem pointless. If the situation feels terminal, perhaps the immediate focus can shift to finding a way to make the *next moment* a little less unbearable. You don't have to solve everything right now; sometimes just getting through the next hour is enough.",
      "source": "target",
